格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A meticulously curated list of useful plugins, extensions, tools and development resources built for DSH, covering productivity enhancement, functional expansion, debugging utilities and custom development modules.","id":"gh:1332582761","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"awesome-DSH-plugin","slug":"Alex-Yanggg/awesome-DSH-plugin","topics":["agents","awesome","awesome-list","deepseek","dsh-plugin","plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A meticulously curated list of useful plugins, extensions, tools and development resources built for"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" DSH, covering productivity enhancement, functional expansion, debugging utilities and custom develo"},{"id":"p1s3","text":" productivity enhancement, functional expansion, debugging utilities and custom development modules."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Awesome DeepSeek Harness Plugins"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> A community-curated, vendor-neutral catalog of plugins for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) — from developer"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" tooling and data workflows to media, operations, and everyday life."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Language:** English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugins can connect an agent to tools, services, devices, and repeatable workflows."},{"id":"p5s2","text":" This list is intentionally broad: if it gives an agent a useful real-world capability, it belongs h"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"s list is intentionally broad: if it gives an agent a useful real-world capability, it belongs here."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Contents"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Getting started\n- Plugin catalog\n- Developer tools\n- UI & user experience\n- Agent orchestration & "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"automation\n- Productivity & collaboration\n- Data, research & knowledge\n- Cloud, DevOps & observabili"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ty\n- AI, design & media\n- Business, finance & commerce\n- Life, devices & the physical world\n- Add a "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"plugin\n- Catalog rules"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Getting started"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"1. Browse a category below and open a plugin's repository or marketplace page.\n2. Follow that plugin"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"'s installation instructions for DeepSeek Harness.\n3. Restart or reload DeepSeek Harness if the plug"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" instructions for DeepSeek Harness.\n3. Restart or reload DeepSeek Harness if the plugin requires it."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> The catalog links to third-party projects. Review a plugin's source, permissions, and data-handlin"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"g policy before installing it."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Plugin catalog"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Developer tools"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- billion-context-dsh — Model-driven context compression (ACP) for DeepSeek Harness, ported from bil"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"lion-context-pi — the model decides when and what to compress."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- Code2Skill — Generate Functions, MCP tools, workflow Skills, and offline test packages from user-a"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"uthorized source code."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- deepseek-harness-acp — An ACP profile plugin and standalone server that exposes the full DSH agent"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" to Zed and other ACP clients while sharing DSH credentials and sessions."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- dsh-artifact — A send_artifact tool that validates model-produced files and delivers structured de"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"scriptors through the standard dsh event stream for any client to render."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- dsh-bash-encoding — Automatically detects and decodes Bash output encodings including UTF-16LE, UT"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"F-8, and GBK for Windows and WSL."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- dsh-custom-tool — Create and manage sandboxed JavaScript tools with a Monaco editor and a model-dr"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ol — Create and manage sandboxed JavaScript tools with a Monaco editor and a model-driven lifecycle."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- dsh-git-identity — Pins Git commit authorship to the active environment identity, prioritizing the"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" signed-in GitHub CLI account."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- dsh-open-in-vscode — Open DeepSeek Harness workspace directories in VS Code from the web interface"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" dsh-open-in-vscode — Open DeepSeek Harness workspace directories in VS Code from the web interface."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- dsh-recommend — Transparent rankings and recommendations for the DSH plugin ecosystem: daily auto-"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"fetched topic data, an open scoring model, and rank/search/recommend tools with a settings-page lead"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"topic data, an open scoring model, and rank/search/recommend tools with a settings-page leaderboard."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- dhicoc/dsh-reverse-skill — A DeepSeek Harness Cordis plugin that routes an 85-skill pack for rever"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"se engineering and authorized security research."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- dsh-balance-meter — Live DeepSeek account balance and session cost in the DSH Web composer dock, w"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ith auto-fetched official pricing and peak/off-peak support.\n- dsh-spend — Token usage and estimated"},{"id":"p23s3","text":" spend statistics for the DSH web UI: floating panel with per-model, per-day, and per-session views."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- dsh-billing — DeepSeek account balance and per-session cost as header pills, slash commands, and a"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"n agent tool, with configurable pricing and automatic 12-hour sync of the official price list."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- plugin-registry — A browser-based plugin management console with official guidance for creating DS"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" A browser-based plugin management console with official guidance for creating DSH plugins.\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### UI & user experience"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- deepseek-harness-tui — A Rust terminal client that speaks the DSH SDK JSON-RPC protocol directly a"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"nd runs standalone or as a profile bundle."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- DSH Better Sidebar — A sidebar workbench with extensible tabs, file viewing and editing, terminal,"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" Git, and sub-agent tools."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- dsh-annotation — Adds Codex-style text annotations: select text, attach a note to the next message"},{"id":"p29s2","text":", and receive annotation-aware replies."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- dsh-at-file — Adds Codex-style @file mentions to search workspace files and attach their contents "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"le — Adds Codex-style @file mentions to search workspace files and attach their contents to prompts."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- dsh-browser-panel — Embeds a headed browser in the DSH Web UI so agents can operate a real browser"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" with visible steps."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- dsh-cc-tui — A Claude Code-style full-screen terminal interface with streaming thought display, ro"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"llback controls, and context/TPS indicators."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- dsh-genui — Renders interactive UI components inline in assistant replies, including charts, forms"},{"id":"p33s2","text":", quizzes, Mermaid diagrams, 3D scenes, and model action events."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- dsh-grok-tui — Use dsh via grok-build's tui."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- dsh-input-history — Adds terminal-style Ctrl+Up and Ctrl+Down navigation through sent messages whi"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"le preserving the latest unsent draft."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- dsh-message-edit — Branch-based message editing with reroll, retry, and a version timeline for Dee"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"pSeek Harness conversations."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- dsh-minigames — Adds an extensible DSH Web UI panel with 18 offline mini-games for breaks while wa"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"iting on agent work."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"- dsh-navbar — Adds a right-edge navigation strip for quickly jumping between user-message nodes in "},{"id":"p38s2","text":"Adds a right-edge navigation strip for quickly jumping between user-message nodes in a conversation."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- dsh-paste-input — Enhances file input with paste, drag and drop, and file picking; submitted files"},{"id":"p39s2","text":" are copied into the session workspace."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"- dsh-qq2006 — A switchable QQ2006 skin for the DeepSeek Harness Web UI with a coral-blue theme and "},{"id":"p40s2","text":"— A switchable QQ2006 skin for the DeepSeek Harness Web UI with a coral-blue theme and retro assets."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"- dsh-skin — Codex-style skin switcher + custom wallpaper for the DSH Web UI: curated --dsw-alias-* "},{"id":"p41s2","text":"palettes, translucent main canvas/sidebar (overrideTokens) with opacity and blur controls."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
